  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "The sources are an about-us page and a fall office catering menu for Salvia Kitchen.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_36755759dbde"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ana and her brother Tomas run it, and they opened their commercial kitchen in 2022.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_36755759dbde"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_36755759dbde"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum, and family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice, and delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown or $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Trays cost $24 per person and boxed lunches cost $16, a gap of $8. Trays come only in sizes for 15, 25 or 40 guests. How is a group of 30 priced?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Baby showers are one of the two main parts of the business, yet the menu covers only office orders. Does the 72 hours notice rule apply to showers too?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_36755759dbde"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Produce comes from farms within 40 miles, but free delivery covers only 10 miles of downtown. How often do customers pay the $35 delivery fee?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_36755759dbde"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_05f254e3160a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
